{"id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-circuit-classes.md","title":"一致电路复杂度类","display":"df-circuit-classes — 一致电路复杂度类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-circuit-classes","aliases":["29-df-circuit-classes"],"display":"df-circuit-classes — 一致电路复杂度类","depends_on":["[[29-df-circuit-model]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-fo-query]]","[[29-df-string-structures]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_locator":"Definitions 5.16–5.17, pp.79–80, DjVu scans 94–95; Definition 2.27, p.37, scan 52","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-circuit-classes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-circuit-classes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-classes — 一致电路复杂度类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77b08debbb908b92\" href=\"?note=77b08debbb908b92\" title=\"29-df-circuit-model\">29-df-circuit-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definitions 5.16–5.17, pp.79–80, DjVu scans 94–95; Definition 2.27, p.37, scan 52"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；输入是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>；有序同构通过该扩张比较，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BQ}_\\tau^&lt;\">\\(\\mathsf{BQ}_\\tau^&lt;\\)</span> 在下式定义。编码为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)\\)</span>，只编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的输入符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_\\tau(n)=|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)|\">\\(N_\\tau(n)=|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)|\\)</span> 对同大小输入恒定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gates}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gates}\\)</span> 及固定词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c\">\\(\\tau_c\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"77b08debbb908b92\" href=\"?note=77b08debbb908b92\" title=\"29-df-circuit-model\">29-df-circuit-model</a> 的内部定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\geq1}\">\\(\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_n=\\mathfrak A_{0^n}^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\">\\(Z_n=\\mathfrak A_{0^n}^{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\)</span> 是标准全零字符串结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Z=\\{Z_n:n\\geq1\\}\">\\(\\mathcal Z=\\{Z_n:n\\geq1\\}\\)</span> 是合法生成输入集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\sigma,\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]\">\\(\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\sigma,\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a>，仅在该集合上要求输出域非空及根常量唯一。</li>\n<li>一阶一致性是下式定义的电路生成性质；允许有限前缀电路单独硬编码，以覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时元组解释无法产生多个门的退化情形。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq0\">\\(i\\geq0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil^i\">\\(t_i(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil^i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(V)\\to(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow V\\in S))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(V)\\to(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow V\\in S))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d,n_0\\geq1\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S},\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;C_n=f(Z_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d,n_0\\geq1\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S},\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;C_n=f(Z_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B,t]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal C\\mid\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;(C_n\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N_\\tau(n))\\land\\operatorname{Gates}(C_n)\\subseteq\\mathcal B)\\land\\exists c,d,N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\leq c(n+1)^d\\land(n\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\leq c\\,t(n)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B,t]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal C\\mid\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;(C_n\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N_\\tau(n))\\land\\operatorname{Gates}(C_n)\\subseteq\\mathcal B)\\land\\exists c,d,N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\leq c(n+1)^d\\land(n\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\leq c\\,t(n)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{&lt;}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ThC}[t_i,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ThC}[t_i,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq1}\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq1}\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definitions 5.16–5.17，印刷页79–80、扫描页94–95；底层电路见 Definition 2.27，页37、扫描页52。本条把旧的未给来源 DLOGTIMEUniform 改为原书实际使用的一阶生成式。索引 n 是输入结构域大小，不是其编码长度；电路有 N_tau(n) 个输入叶。门集只约束内部门，避免把输入叶排除出合法电路。有限前缀修补是本地明确约定：大小固定的有序结构只有有限多个同构类型，其性质可由有限原子图式处理，因此不改变任何所列逻辑捕获类。底层电路现由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"77b08debbb908b92\" href=\"?note=77b08debbb908b92\" title=\"29-df-circuit-model\">29-df-circuit-model</a> 给出有限结构、标签约束、输入编号、阈值及终止求值，不再借助外部数据类型。</p>\n<p>本轮显式区分有序对 U=(A,L) 与结构 O_tau(U)：同构只应用于结构，编码通过有序对重载并只计输入符号。此前把有序对直接送入结构同构并用未绑定的域记号 |A|，存在接口类型失配；改写未改变电路资源界或一致性要求。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-circuit-model","status":"resolved","id":"77b08debbb908b92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3