,"id":"77b08debbb908b92","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)$、$\\operatorname{Eval}$、$\\operatorname{size}$、$\\operatorname{depth}$、$\\operatorname{Gates}$ 及固定词汇 $\\tau_c$ 均取 [[29-df-circuit-model]] 的内部定义。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\geq1}$；$Z_n=\\mathfrak A_{0^n}^{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}$ 是标准全零字符串结构；$\\mathcal Z=\\{Z_n:n\\geq1\\}$ 是合法生成输入集合；$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\sigma,\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]，仅在该集合上要求输出域非空及根常量唯一。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-model","status":"resolved","id":"77b08debbb908b92","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definitions 5.16–5.17，印刷页79–80、扫描页94–95；底层电路见 Definition 2.27，页37、扫描页52。本条把旧的未给来源 DLOGTIMEUniform 改为原书实际使用的一阶生成式。索引 n 是输入结构域大小，不是其编码长度；电路有 N_tau(n) 个输入叶。门集只约束内部门，避免把输入叶排除出合法电路。有限前缀修补是本地明确约定：大小固定的有序结构只有有限多个同构类型，其性质可由有限原子图式处理，因此不改变任何所列逻辑捕获类。底层电路现由 [[29-df-circuit-model]] 给出有限结构、标签约束、输入编号、阈值及终止求值，不再借助外部数据类型。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{BQ}_\\tau^<","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"N_\\tau(n)=|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eval}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gates}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_n=\\mathfrak A_{0^n}^{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Z=\\{Z_n:n\\geq1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\sigma,\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"t_i(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil^i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{BQ}^{<}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\forall U,V\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\cong\\mathfrak O_\\tau(V)\\to(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow V\\in S))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists d,n_0\\geq1\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\tau_{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S},\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;C_n=f(Z_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_2,\\mathrm{OR}_2,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{AND}_\\omega,\\mathrm{OR}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\},\\quad\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{THRESH}_\\omega,\\mathrm{NOT}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B,t]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal C\\mid\\operatorname{FOUniform}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;(C_n\\in\\operatorname{Circuit}(N_\\tau(n))\\land\\operatorname{Gates}(C_n)\\subseteq\\mathcal B)\\land\\exists c,d,N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\leq c(n+1)^d\\land(n\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\leq c\\,t(n)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{<}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{NC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{<}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{AC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThC}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathsf{BQ}^{<}_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\mathcal C\\in\\operatorname{Circ}_\\tau[\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm{ThC}},t]\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\;(U\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Eval}(C_{n_U},\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U))=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AC}[t_i,\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ThC}[t_i,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq1}\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{AC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{AC}^i[\\tau],\\quad\\mathrm{ThC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\geq0}\\mathrm{ThC}^i[\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":5438,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c9c7148ba67afbb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小、无界扇入 AND/OR/NOT 电路查询类；与 $Q$ 使用同一有序输入编码。"},{"id":"8277156a4d684ae0","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]$、$Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[<])[\\tau]$、$Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[<])[\\tau]$ 使用 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]] 的同域接口；$\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]$ 使用 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 的一阶一致性。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-classes]] — 一阶一致的 `\\mathrm{NC}^i,\\mathrm{AC}^i,\\mathrm{ThC}^i`"},{"id":"a1359bbd5a5c2a70","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ 为有限关系输入词汇，$<\\notin\\tau$；其角色与 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 一致。"},{"id":"7be47cc899abd763","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小阈